# Short link for bulk SMS / print / flyers: /join -> WhatsApp community.
# Carrier and bulk-SMS spam filters score raw chat.whatsapp.com links hard, so
# messages point at our own domain and land here instead.
#
# MUST stay above the /* catch-all below: Netlify reads this file top to bottom
# and stops at the first match. It must also live in THIS file, not
# netlify.toml -- _redirects is processed in full before netlify.toml is, so a
# rule there would never be reached. The trailing ! forces the redirect.
#
# To change which group /join opens, edit both URLs below. Nothing else
# in the codebase references them.
/join     https://chat.whatsapp.com/KjRTIFVRF4443pD4p1Q2cI   302!
/join/    https://chat.whatsapp.com/KjRTIFVRF4443pD4p1Q2cI   302!

